--
N5008 [dcl.fct]/[expr.type]: a function template whose trailing return type
nests a decltype inside a template-id (`-> R<decltype(c.begin())>`) must resolve
the decltype (with parameter names in scope) during deduction.  CBMC only scoped
parameters when the whole return type was a decltype; fixed by scanning the
return type for any nested decltype in guess_function_template_args.  This is the
util/range.h make_range(container) shape.  assertion.2 provides non-vacuity.
